{"lyrics":"[00:02.88]Na-na, uh-uh-uh\n[00:11.02](Niko Mothafuckin' Skip)\n[00:12.70]Woah, woah-woah\n[00:13.94]Woah-woah, woah-woah\n[00:18.48]Woah-woah, woah, woah-woah\n[00:23.30]Uh\n[00:27.88]Woah-woah\n[00:29.50]My name's JuiceTheKidd in case you didn't know\n[00:32.36]Now you know, you heard me?\n[00:34.12]Yeah, ayy\n[00:36.84]Where do I start?\n[00:37.72]I don't really know what to say\n[00:40.48]I just wanna thank God for a wonderful day\n[00:43.60]I just wanna thank God for this blunt and this haze\n[00:46.56]That I'm about to roll up and put this shit to my face\n[00:49.84]I just hope my mom don't think that I'm a disgrace\n[00:52.60]'Cause she see weed, drugs, girls all over the place\n[00:55.98]I'm just tryna' get this money, put it all on a plate\n[00:58.92]So all my niggas, we can eat it, yeah, then we'll be straight\n[01:02.18]I'm just tryna' get the money, I'm just tryna' get the mula, I'm not tryna' be conceded though\n[01:08.30]And all my niggas in the streets, clips long, in them Ruger's, give they ass a reason to, yeah\n[01:14.52]And I've been chillin' with my goons, I've been chillin' with my demons, little more then I needed to, yeah\n[01:20.80]And this verse go out to the girl, ayy, bitch, fucked around, I needed you, uh, damn\n[01:30.78]I'ma go ahead and step out of my lane\n[01:33.80]I got money like Monopoly\n[01:36.44]But then again nigga, this is not one of them games, okay, yeah\n[01:39.80]These niggas so fool, I swear these niggas so lame, ayy, yeah\n[01:48.80]But fuck them niggas, look\n[01:52.44]Yesterday, I had a revelation, I saw me at a fancy restaurant makin' reservations\n[01:57.86]I saw me shakin' the world ain't talkin' about a Haitians\n[02:00.98]I saw me havin' addicts and I'm servin' in the basement\n[02:04.06]I saw me as a rap god and a trap god, 'cause I rap hard and I trap hard\n[02:10.54]My brothers servin' fiends, right out the backyard, damn\n[02:14.60]Why you frontin' in the backyard? That's how a bitch nigga get his fuckin' ass tossed\n[02:19.98]A couple shots will leave him layin' on the asphalt\n[02:23.08]And that's merched on me, and on my homies\n[02:26.36]Run up on me, I'ma leave your girlfriend lonely\n[02:29.60]I'll take you out the picture, take you out the picture\n[02:32.92]Life is just a movie, I'm just writin' my description\n[02:36.08]Boy, I swear to God all I see is these visions\n[02:39.00]My niggas in the cut, they comparin' us to scissors\n[02:41.92]We sharp, in the water looking like sharks\n[02:45.08]Two bitches at a time, nigga no Noah's Ark\n[02:48.46]Fly in this bitch, ain't talkin' Bonaparte\n[02:51.56]Talkin' dumb to me and I'ma tear your bones apart\n[02:54.36]That's real, I don't really know how to say it\n[02:57.62]I don't really wanna say it, fuck around, I'ma spray it\n[03:00.78]I got the gun on my hip, nigga fuck it, keep playin'\n[03:03.60]I swear to god I'm the man, motherfucker not playin'\n[03:06.84]I'm so serious, poppin' Xans until I'm delirious\n[03:10.36]All these monkeys like George, a little too curious\n[03:13.48]Hope you niggas hearin' it, too fast for the furious\n[03:16.64]Niggas talkin' dumb and that choppa go ahead and kill him\n[03:19.26]Boy I swear I'ma turn up, excited delirium\n[03:22.60]Huh, Like excited delirium\n[03:28.80]Yeah, reflections just like a mirror shit\n[03:36.44]JuiceTheKidd is my name\n[03:39.92]Life is just a picture\n[03:42.18]I'm just tryna make myself a frame\n[03:44.14]Yeah, somebody show me the ways to this game\n[03:50.56]'Cause I'm through playin' games\n[03:55.18]Yeah, I'm through playin' games","words":[[2.88,3.4,"Na-na,"],[5.74,8.0,"uh-uh-uh"],[11.02,11.42,"(Niko"],[11.74,12.42,"Mothafuckin'"],[12.46,12.66,"Skip)"],[12.7,12.82,"Woah,"],[12.86,13.9,"woah-woah"],[13.94,15.54,"Woah-woah,"],[15.58,17.58,"woah-woah"],[18.48,20.06,"Woah-woah,"],[20.24,21.58,"woah,"],[21.78,23.26,"woah-woah"],[23.3,23.34,"Uh"],[27.88,29.46,"Woah-woah"],[29.5,29.54,"My"],[29.58,29.74,"name's"],[29.78,30.22,"JuiceTheKidd"],[30.2